    <article class="content ">
      
      <div class="inkling-intro-cta tinker-cta-row">

















  <a class="btn primary lg" href="https://tinker.thinkingmachines.ai/playground?utm_source=blog&amp;utm_campaign=inkling_small_model_release" target="_blank">Try on Tinker</a>
























  <a class="btn plain lg btn-with-chevron" href="/model-card/inkling-small/">Model card<svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M6.56701 3.34347C6.78189 3.14201 7.1194 3.1529 7.32086 3.36779L11.3208 7.63446C11.5131 7.8396 11.5131 8.15884 11.3208 8.36399L7.32086 12.6306C7.1194 12.8456 6.78189 12.8565 6.56701 12.655C6.35212 12.4535 6.34123 12.116 6.54269 11.9011L10.2007 7.99922L6.54269 4.09733C6.34123 3.88244 6.35212 3.54492 6.56701 3.34347Z" fill="currentColor"/></svg></a>
























  <a class="btn plain lg btn-with-chevron" href="https://huggingface.co/thinkingmachines/Inkling-Small" target="_blank">Hugging Face<svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M6.56701 3.34347C6.78189 3.14201 7.1194 3.1529 7.32086 3.36779L11.3208 7.63446C11.5131 7.8396 11.5131 8.15884 11.3208 8.36399L7.32086 12.6306C7.1194 12.8456 6.78189 12.8565 6.56701 12.655C6.35212 12.4535 6.34123 12.116 6.54269 11.9011L10.2007 7.99922L6.54269 4.09733C6.34123 3.88244 6.35212 3.54492 6.56701 3.34347Z" fill="currentColor"/></svg></a>







</div>
<p>Today, we are releasing Inkling-Small, an efficient open-weights model that achieves comparable performance to <a href="/news/introducing-inkling/">Inkling</a> at a quarter of its size.</p>
<p>Inkling-Small is a Mixture-of-Experts transformer with 276B total parameters, 12B active, trained on NVIDIA GB300 NVL72 systems. Like Inkling, it features native reasoning over audio and images, variable thinking effort, a context window of up to 1M tokens, and well-rounded performance across a range of benchmarks.</p>









  
  

  
  


<figure class="model-parameter-comparison">
  <div class="model-parameter-comparison-panels">
    
      
      
      
      <section class="model-parameter-panel model-card--inklingsmall" style="--waffle-accent: #8F3F71">
        <h3 class="model-parameter-title">Inkling-Small</h3>
        <div class="model-card-waffle">
          







<div class="model-card-waffle-grid" style="--waffle-cols: 25" role="img"
     data-waffle-sequence="0"
