<p class="benchmark-results-note">Audio and vision benchmarks against specialist omni models (open- and closed-weight), reported at effort=0.99.</p>
<h3 id="epistemics">Epistemics</h3>
<p>Inkling-Small was trained similarly to Inkling on epistemics, focusing on calibration, instruction following, and resistance to censorship. Inkling-Small matches Inkling’s performance on forecasting. Calibration involved RL against proper scoring rules on a large corpus of real-world forecasting questions, improving its ability to express appropriate confidence and produce calibrated forecasts under uncertainty.</p>
